#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah volume panggilan untuk setiap output. Level diterapkan secara "
"otomatis saat panggilan tersambung dan setiap kali output berubah selama "
"panggilan, dan perubahan slider langsung terdengar. Perangkat keras "
"menerapkan level dalam langkah-langkah kasar, dan earpiece tidak pernah "
"benar-benar hening. Level Bluetooth disimpan untuk dukungan routing "
"mendatang."

